      "category": "inferred",
      "description": "LLM 抽取器（stub provider）产出含 fingerprint 关键词的 claim，经 runtime auto-Approve 升为 active（authority=inferred 经 ProposeMemory → Approve），sentinel 'auto-approved' 与 status=active 等价",
